  "summary": "Seasons of the year, guilds, a dynamic ecosystem, and more",
  "description": "💥SubMine opens its doors to its players with new features...\n\n● Want mechanisms? Create!\n● Want to explore the world? A variety of biomes and dungeons will brighten up your leisure time.\n● Want to farm? A variety of crops and mechanics will help you with that.\n● Tired of boring mobs? No problem! There are new ones!\n● Want to protect your building? Privates will help you!\n\nAnd much more!\n🗣The server will start on May 2 at 16:00 Moscow time.\n\n👋How to get to our server?\nIP: mc.submine.net\nVersion: 1.21.1\nKernel: Neoforge\n❗It is also important to install the server modpack (without it, you will not be able to enter the server)!\n\n🤩We are waiting for you dear friends! And may luck be on your side)\n#SubMine #SubMineminecraft",
